=== The red, observed and not argued ===

The gate rebuilt in a throwaway worktree with RfpMinPly defaulting to 1 --
a setoption cannot reach a test binary -- and the mate-in-two REQUIREs
turned into CHECKs so the run reaches the floor. The test file is the
working tree's, so the floor observed failing is the one being committed.

